  body: |
    # Benefit purpose in the source’s income-deprivation guidance

    ## Authored interpretation

    The source requires a significant benefit purpose for deprivation of income and consideration of the facts, distinguishing income already received and an enforceable immediately repayable debt.

    ## Scope and boundaries

    DMG 51469, 51472–51473 and 51485–51486 name ESA(IR), IS and JSA(IB), but no cross-benefit equivalence is inferred. Explanations, timing and other evidence are relevant; disposal or non-receipt alone does not establish purpose.

    ## Inspected source passages

    - [DMG 51469, PDF page 130](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a16f9cf534e7e99adaeaa5/dmg-ch-51.pdf#page=130)
    - [DMG 51472, PDF page 130](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a16f9cf534e7e99adaeaa5/dmg-ch-51.pdf#page=130)
    - [DMG 51473, PDF page 130](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a16f9cf534e7e99adaeaa5/dmg-ch-51.pdf#page=130)
    - [DMG 51485, PDF page 132](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a16f9cf534e7e99adaeaa5/dmg-ch-51.pdf#page=132)
    - [DMG 51486, PDF page 132](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69a16f9cf534e7e99adaeaa5/dmg-ch-51.pdf#page=132)

    ## Evidence and review status

    This is an unreviewed, model-assisted interpretation of selected passages in the frozen DWP guidance. It is an independent experimental publication, not an official DWP document, an entitlement decision or an executable benefits rule. ESA(Cont), ESA(IR), New Style ESA, UC and Pension Credit are not equated. The captured source contains historical, transitional and potentially superseded provisions; no complete or current legal rule set is claimed. Machine extraction can affect reading order, footnotes and characters. No visual PDF review or specialist acceptance is claimed.

    Source captured: 2026-09-15T19:45:30.832715Z. This is an acquisition time, not a publication, revision or commencement date. Source-stated dates retain their own role and precision.

